launch-menu is a modified copy of the `new-menu` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: the agent list follows data/launch-menu/config.json
(order, hidden agents, extra flags, per-agent bypass; config.js); a right-click
on an agent turns its skip-permissions flag on or off and saves the config;
⇧-click starts it without, ⌥-click splits right; ↑/↓ and Enter work on every
row. Its last agent list is kept in shared "launch-menu.agents" (Herdr's
new-menu keeps "new-menu.agents", which this only reads).
